>⭐ 4.51</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">¥8,500〜</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F4843%2F4843.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;\">\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f766e; white-space: nowrap;\">7位</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F16068%2F16068.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0f766e; text-decoration: underline;\">びわ湖大津プリンスホテル</a></td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #d97706; white-space: nowrap;\">⭐ 4.44</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #334155; white-space: nowrap;\">¥5,000〜</td>\n            <td style=\"padding: 10px 12px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap;\"><a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F16068%2F16068.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #d97706; color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;\">空室・最安値 ➔</a></td>\n          </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【滋賀県の有名なもの完全ガイド】観光名所・ご当地グルメ・定番お土産・地酒ランキング</h2>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\">滋賀県の誇る雄大な自然美と歴史ある街並み、名湯温泉、絶品ご当地グルメを満喫できる人気観光ハブ。</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 to-orange-50/50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\">🌟 滋賀県のハイライト＆名物グルメ</h3>\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">📌 主要な観光ハイライト</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">琵琶湖・彦根・長浜名所・滋賀県名物・絶景温泉</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border border-stone-200\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900 block mb-1\">🍴 代表的なご当地グルメ</strong>\n      <p class=\"text-stone-600\">滋賀県近江牛のしゃぶしゃぶ・ビワマス料理・鴨鍋・鮒寿司</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🏯 滋賀県で絶対に訪れるべき有名な観光名所</h3>\n<div class=\"space-y-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">1</span>\n            琵琶湖（白髭神社・竹生島）\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本最大の面積と貯水量を誇る湖。湖中に朱色の鳥居が立つ「近江の厳島」白髭神社や、神の宿るパワースポット竹生島へのクルージングが人気です。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">2</span>\n            国宝 彦根城\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">琵琶湖を見下ろす高台に佇む国宝天守。当時の姿を留める堀や石垣、城下町の風情と人気キャラクター「ひこにゃん」の登場が訪れる人を笑顔にします。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">3</span>\n            比叡山 延暦寺\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">最澄によって開かれた日本仏教の母山であり世界文化遺産。比叡山の山頂に広がる東塔・西塔・横川の各エリアに千二百年の不滅の法灯が灯り続けます。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">4</span>\n            近江八幡の水郷めぐり\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">豊臣秀次が築いた城下町の堀割を手漕ぎ和舟でゆったり巡る風情ある体験。四季折々のヨシ原や白壁の土蔵が並ぶ町並みがノスタルジックです。</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-1 mt-6 mb-3\">🎁 滋賀県で喜ばれる人気定番お土産（日持ち・個包装）</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 my-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 滋賀県 伝統銘菓「特製和菓子」</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold\">伝統銘菓</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">滋賀県で長年愛される伝統銘菓。しっとりした上品な甘みと職人技が光る極上手土産。</p>\n        </div>\n      \n        <div class=\"p-3.5 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n            <strong class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-900\">🎁 滋賀県 トレンド高級ラングドシャ</strong>\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-100 text-stone-600 rounded-md font-semibold